# Rights of the users on the login-only listener (port 1884, #1962).
# A user not named here may do nothing. No passwords here: those are in the
# password file the deploy provides (docs/mqtt-car-user.md).

# The car app. It publishes ioniq/parsed/#, ioniq/raw/#, ioniq/log and its
# will/status topic ioniq/status. It may read what ev-journal publishes for
# the car, but never write it, and nothing else outside ioniq/.
user ioniq
topic readwrite ioniq/#
topic read homy/ioniq/journeys
topic read homy/ioniq/road_check
topic read homy/ioniq/home
